{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24741","headline":"福先寺雪中饯刘苏州 · 白居易","name":"福先寺雪中饯刘苏州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"送君何处展离筵，大梵王宫大雪天。\n庾岭梅花落歌管，谢家柳絮扑金田。\n乱从纨袖交加舞，醉入篮轝取次眠。\n却笑召邹兼访戴，只持空酒驾空船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24741.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24741","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}